1
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:19,820
Salut, Marinette. Tu as l'air malade.
Hi, Marinette. You look sick.

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,684
Oui, j'ai un rhume et de la fièvre.
Yes, I have a cold and a fever.

3
00:00:23,784 --> 00:00:26,348
Tu tousses beaucoup ?
Are you coughing a lot?

4
00:00:26,448 --> 00:00:30,548
Oui, je tousse beaucoup et j'ai mal au dos.
Yes, I'm coughing a lot and my back hurts.

5
00:00:30,648 --> 00:00:33,596
Tu as pris un médicament ?
Did you take any medicine?

6
00:00:33,696 --> 00:00:37,364
Oui, mais je viens d'éternuer.
Yes, but I just sneezed.

7
00:00:37,464 --> 00:00:44,228
Repose-toi : la santé, c'est important. Tu vas guérir bientôt.
Get some rest: health is important. You'll recover soon.

8
00:00:44,328 --> 00:00:49,652
Merci ! J'espère que je ne vais pas vomir.
Thanks! I hope I'm not going to vomit.
